I added a brief comment to the `resume_background` that precedes the clipboard code. I think it's better placed there, as it avoids someone from accidentally removing the `resume_background` call.

```cpp
// GetClipboardData might block for up to 30s for delay-rendered contents.
co_await winrt::resume_background();
```
